WEBVTT - North Star Bakery Behind the Scenes

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Every morning at North Star Bakery begins long before sunrise.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
We mix organic regional flour, water, and our 10-year-old sourdough starter.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Our dough undergoes a slow 36-hour cold fermentation for rich flavor and digestibility.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.000
Loaves are hand-shaped and baked on hot stone hearths until golden and crusty.
